\n✅️Copywriting\n✅️Marketing Funnel architecture\n✅️Sales funnel design\n✅️Email marketing\n✅️Email automation strategy, tech and up\n✅️Marketing automation\n✅️Chatbots\n✅️Chatbot automation\n✅️Paid ads . PPC.\n✅️SMM\n✅️SEO\n✅️SEM\n✅️Web design\n✅️Website conversion optimization\n✅️Landing page design\n✅️Lead Capture Strategies\n✅️List growing strategies\n✅️Lead magnet optimization\n✅️Content creation\n✅️Persuasion mastery\n✅️Offer Creation\n✅️Negotiation\n✅️Artificial Intelligence for marketers\n✅️Data Analytics\n✅️Performance optimization.\n\n"},{"t":"br"}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"t":"section","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 fbZNNf  ","a":{"id":"98a94859-8021-4750-93ea-90bd3a9982be"},"ch":[{"t":"div","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 dOqGpd container ","a":{"id":""},"ch":[{"t":"div","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 dOqGpd row justify-content-start align-items-start ","a":{"id":""},"ch":[{"t":"div","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 dOqGpd col-sm-12 col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12 ","a":{"id":""},"ch":[{"t":"div","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 gVSXwr  ","a":{"id":""},"ch":[{"t":"h5","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 lmcchh undefined undefined","a":{"dir":"auto"},"ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"My Work"}]},{"t":"h3","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 eZMfCl undefined undefined","a":{"dir":"auto"},"ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"My work summarised with pictures"}]},{"t":"div","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 hohFZK undefined ","a":{"dir":"auto"},"ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"I am a tech savvy Digital Marketing Consultatn, trainer, speaker and author."},{"t":"div","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Having a background in engineering and practicing digital marketing for over 11years. I have strong passion for small business owners and growing businesses. I love to talk about and teach digital entreprenuership. Larn more here."}]}]},{"t":"div","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 dOqGpd  ","a":{"id":""},"ch":[{"t":"div","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 dOqGpd row justify-content-start align-items-start ","a":{"id":""},"ch":[{"t":"div","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 dOqGpd col-sm-6 col-6 col-md-6 col-lg-3 ","a":{"id":""},"ch":[{"t":"div","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 kzzSsO  ","a":{"id